From 14d4239d073b8d42dc2aedf8d3a2d55953862502 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: caoanhhao <caoanhhao2@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 12:07:51 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] minigbm-vtest: gralloc shim allocating window buffers through
 vtest

libgbm_mesa_wrapper.so replacement for minigbm_gbm_mesa.  GPU-only
buffers (no CPU usage) are allocated on the host GPU with
VCMD_ALLOC_DMABUF_IMAGE (vtest protocol 6) and returned with the host's
real modifier (NVIDIA block-linear), limited to the compositor's list
from waydroid.modifiers.<fourcc>.<n>.  Everything else, and any vtest
failure, goes to the original wrapper, loaded from
/vendor/lib64/libgbm_mesa_wrapper_intel.so.

Disabled unless waydroid.gralloc.vtest=1.  The socket comes from
waydroid.gralloc.vtest.socket, then mesa.vtest.socket.name.

The vendor wrapper's struct alloc_args layout was checked against the
shipped LineageOS 20 binary (out_fd 0x18, out_stride 0x1c,
out_modifier 0x20).

